
# Goal Definition
std_msgs/Header header
string task_id
string target_obj_name
string expected_frame_id
bool need_6d_pose
bool need_env_point_cloud
float32 point_cloud_downsample_resolution
int32 priority
int8 type
---
# Result Definition
bool success
std_msgs/Header header
uint8 status_code
string error_message
float64 execution_time
geometry_msgs/PoseStamped target_6d_pose
float32 pose_confidence
sensor_msgs/PointCloud2 env_point_cloud
string point_cloud_frame_id
---
# Feedback Definition
string task_status
float32 progress_rate
string current_step_info
std_msgs/Header header
